## Traded picks

A trade moves ownership of one team's round-N pick to another team. The pick
stays at the same spot in the snake; a different manager makes the selection.
Total live picks are unchanged — only the per-team distribution shifts.

Rules the loader enforces (all are hard errors):
  - `From` / `To` must be team names from the draft order above (or team_ids).
  - A team cannot trade a round it keeps in (keeper slots resolve first, so
    check the round AFTER any same-round collision cascade).
  - The same (From, Round) cannot be traded twice.

One row per traded pick. Leave the table empty (header only) if no trades.

| From | To | Round |
|---|---|---|
| TODO team name | TODO team name | TODO |

